OL,3,CTV-related anniversaries for 04 OCT
OL,4,CCHANNELS
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1997FBBC One launches its
OL,7,Fballoon-based channel identity. The
OL,8,Fchange coincides with the introduction
OL,9,Fof a new BBC logo.
OL,10,
OL,11,CG1997FThe BBC One on-screen
OL,12,Fpresentation package first seen on 16th
OL,13,FFebruary 1991 bows out just before 3am.
OL,14,
OL,15,CG1997FBBC Two closes down for the
OL,16,Fnight just before 2.30am, using the
OL,17,F1991 - 1997 on-screen presentation
OL,18,Fpackage for the final time.
