OL,3,CTV-related anniversaries for 04 OCT
OL,4,CCHANNELS
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1997FBBC Two comes on air at 7.20am
OL,7,Fwith an updated on-screen identity.
OL,8,FMany of the channel's idents from the
OL,9,F1991 - 1997 period survived the change,
OL,10,Falbeit now slightly zoomed and
OL,11,Fincorporating the new BBC logo. Three
OL,12,Fnew idents were added: Ariel, Paint-Pot
OL,13,Fand Zapper.
